; UTF-8 without BOM, one key=value per line. Use %n for a line break.
; https://jrsoftware.org/ishelp/topic_languagessection.htm
[CustomMessages]
; Missing WebView2 during interactive Setup. The user can accept Microsoft's per-user download or cancel. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated.
WebView2Prompt=Rewards Farmer needs Microsoft Edge WebView2. Download and install the official Microsoft Evergreen Runtime for this user?
; Uninstall found the app running. The user must finish the run, quit the app and try again. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated if mentioned.
QuitBeforeUninstall=Wait for the current run to finish, then quit Rewards Farmer before uninstalling.
; Preparing page found the app running. Finish the run, quit the app and run Setup again.
QuitBeforeUpdate=Wait for the current run to finish, then quit Rewards Farmer before updating.
; Silent Setup preparing page found no WebView2. Install the official Evergreen Runtime, then run Setup again. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated.
WebView2Missing=Microsoft Edge WebView2 is missing. Install the official Evergreen Runtime, then run Setup again.
; Preparing page after the WebView2 download offer was declined. Install the official runtime before retrying Setup. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated.
WebView2Required=Microsoft Edge WebView2 is required. Setup has not installed Rewards Farmer.
; Preparing page after the runtime download failed. Install the official Evergreen Runtime and run Setup again. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated.
WebView2DownloadFailed=The Microsoft WebView2 download failed. Install the official Evergreen Runtime and run Setup again.
; Preparing page rejected the downloaded bootstrapper's signature. Do not run that file; obtain the official runtime and retry Setup. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated.
WebView2InvalidSignature=The WebView2 download does not have a valid Microsoft signature. Setup will not run it.
; Preparing page after runtime installation failed. Install the official Evergreen Runtime and run Setup again. Keep WebView2 and Microsoft untranslated.
WebView2InstallFailed=Microsoft Edge WebView2 could not be installed. Install the official Evergreen Runtime and run Setup again.
